NLP PROCESSES: TECHNICAL GUIDE
==============================

1. EXTRACTION
-------------
- PDF: Page-by-page text extraction.
- DOCX: Paragraph traversal.
- HTML: HTML sanitization and tag stripping.
- TXT: UTF-8 normalization.

2. CLEANING (LEVEL 2)
---------------------
The system removes 'noise' to focus on high-value keywords.
- Process: Lowercase -> ASCII Normalization -> Punctuation Strip -> Whitespace Collapse.

3. SKILL DISCOVERY
------------------
- We match 'Extracted Clean Text' against a dictionary of 1000+ IT skills.
- We use boundary detection to avoid partial word matches.
- Synonym mapping ensures that 'JS' and 'JavaScript' are treated as the same skill.

4. WEIGHTED SCORING
-------------------
The system simulates a recruiter's priorities:
- Core Skills: 60% of score.
- Secondary Skills: 30% of score.
- Bonus Skills: 10% of score.

---
Integration Complete.
